'''Balrog''' is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Street Fighter Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 10.0 Update|Version 10.0]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Balrog
|image = E 529.png
|appearance = [[Fists of Avarice (Easy)]]
|money drop = 1,000¢ - 3,950¢
}}

==Enemy==
The enemy variant of the Cat Unit Balrog. This enemy has high health, damage, DPS and has [[Omni Strike]], but he isn't a big threat due to his single target.

==Strategy==
Proper meatshielding should be enough to stall this enemy while attacking with the classic [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] and [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Cat]].

